	If the character is supposed to have some natural needs such
	as eating, why not implement the need to sleep as well? One
	would have to take a nap every now and then, and the lack of
	sleep would cause coordination and concentration difficulties
	(temporary lowering of int, perhaps dex?). Of course one would
	have to find a peaceful corner to sleep in, and an amulet of
	restful sleep would become useful as it would be possible for
	characters to suffer of insomnia. Eventually a sleepy character
	would just fall asleep anywhere, if this need wasn't taken care
	of.

	Comments?

